By \eqref{def-cnk}, we have that $\operatorname{dens}_k'(\{{\mathfrak p}_n\}) > 2^{-n}$. Thus, by \eqref{eq-densdef}, there exists ${\mathfrak p}' \in {\mathfrak P}(k)$ and $\lambda \ge 2$ with $\lambda {\mathfrak p}_n \le \lambda {\mathfrak p}'$ and
