The first term \eqref{eq-sharp-trunc-term} is at most $2T_{{Q}}^{\vartheta} f(x)$, using with $R_1 := 8D^{s_1}$, $R_2 := \frac{1}{4}D^{s_2-1}$ and $R_1 < R_2 < R_{{Q}}({\vartheta},x')$ the triangle inequality in the form
