We have that $L(x,y)\neq 0$ implies
\begin{equation} y\in B(x, tR)\, .
\end{equation}

We have for $y\in B(x, 2^{-1}tR)$ that
\begin{equation} |L(x,y)|\ge 2^{-1} \ .
